  "idea": "Async decision documentation framework using Github or Notion RFCs",
  "text": "This Request For Comments template gathers thoughtful engineering feedback across twelve time zones seamlessly. Sync meetings force immediate verbal reactions, favoring fast talkers while drowning out analytical teammates. Important architectural flaws slip past undetected because nobody had sufficient quiet time to review trade-offs. Structuring written RFC templates inside Notion gives distributed engineers two days to leave inline comments. You reach consensus with full documentation and zero friction.",
